<title>POLAND: WEDEL AUG NET RISES TO PLN 3.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>WEDEL AUG NET RISES TO PLN 3.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.89 vs   3.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.64 vs   5.05</p>
